  "recommended_training_additions": [
    "A few hundred low-risk native Chinese dialogue/instruction paths after actual semantic checking, split/grouped by full source_tree_id, exact/near duplicates removed.",
    "An explicitly project-authored Traditional Chinese pack for source-grounded one-sentence restatement, missing-reference clarification, counts/format constraints, and history-dependent follow-ups; do not mislabel it as public human dialogue.",
    "Use only official speech TRAIN transcriptions if constructing source-grounded restatement SFT. Keep gold verbatim transcription separate from author-written response and note read-speech is not natural voice-chat data.",
    "Optionally run frozen ASR on TRAIN only to form corrupted-transcript robustness pairs, ensuring names/numbers do not get invented and severe uncertainty asks clarification; no final-test transcripts or answers used.",
    "Mix with image/OCR records rather than replacing all training with chat; retain clear per-domain validation measures and track both learned new behavior and preserved baseline behavior."
  ],
  "evaluation_plan": [
    "Choose ASR using heldout validation source sentences/speakers; freeze checkpoint selection before final test inference.",
    "Report raw CER, normalized-whitespace/NFKC CER separately. Any Simplified/Traditional canonicalization is a separately named diagnostic, not silently corrected transcript.",
    "Typed gold and spoken-ASR input run through the same unchanged chat prompt/history, separating recognition errors from response errors.",
    "Use new question-shaped human recordings when available and permitted. Reusing FLEURS read statements can only support source-restatement/clarification claims, never a broad natural conversational success rate.",
    "Report model response adequacy/constraint following independently of ASR string accuracy and EOS stop."
  ],
